        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚡ <strong>Circuit Overload</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Circuit Overload</strong> is a fast-paced arcade bullet-hell shooter built around precision, escalation, and pure action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control a combat unit inside a hostile digital environment, facing endless waves of enemies and increasingly complex attack patterns. The longer you survive, the faster and more chaotic the screen becomes — pushing your reflexes, positioning, and decision-making to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is about adaptation and optimization. Choose upgrades on the fly, shape your build mid-run, and find synergies that help you survive just a little longer. There is no safe point — pressure constantly ramps up until the system reaches critical overload.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Circuit Overload focuses on tight controls, visual clarity under chaos, and classic score-driven arcade gameplay. How far you get — and how high you score — depends entirely on skill, timing, and smart build choices.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💿 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-intensity arcade bullet-hell combat</strong><br>Fast, screen-filling action focused on movement, positioning, and reflexes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score-driven gameplay</strong><br>Every run challenges you to survive longer, play cleaner, and push for higher scores.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run-based upgrades and build shaping</strong><br>Adapt your loadout mid-run with meaningful upgrade choices that affect your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escalating wave pressure</strong><br>Enemy speed, density, and attack patterns continuously intensify the longer you survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tight, responsive controls</strong><br>Designed for precision and consistent, skill-based play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distinct neon sci-fi visual style</strong><br>Clean, glowing visuals with layered effects built for clarity even at peak chaos.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚡ <strong>Circuit Overload</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Circuit Overload</strong> is a fast-paced arcade bullet-hell shooter built around precision, escalation, and pure action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control a combat unit inside a hostile digital environment, facing endless waves of enemies and increasingly complex attack patterns. The longer you survive, the faster and more chaotic the screen becomes — pushing your reflexes, positioning, and decision-making to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is about adaptation and optimization. Choose upgrades on the fly, shape your build mid-run, and find synergies that help you survive just a little longer. There is no safe point — pressure constantly ramps up until the system reaches critical overload.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Circuit Overload focuses on tight controls, visual clarity under chaos, and classic score-driven arcade gameplay. How far you get — and how high you score — depends entirely on skill, timing, and smart build choices.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💿 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-intensity arcade bullet-hell combat</strong><br>Fast, screen-filling action focused on movement, positioning, and reflexes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score-driven gameplay</strong><br>Every run challenges you to survive longer, play cleaner, and push for higher scores.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run-based upgrades and build shaping</strong><br>Adapt your loadout mid-run with meaningful upgrade choices that affect your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escalating wave pressure</strong><br>Enemy speed, density, and attack patterns continuously intensify the longer you survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tight, responsive controls</strong><br>Designed for precision and consistent, skill-based play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distinct neon sci-fi visual style</strong><br>Clean, glowing visuals with layered effects built for clarity even at peak chaos.</p></li></ul>",
